5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a destination that is logically sound and financially transparent. Let's divide the research to avoid overlap.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,Agreed. I want to ensure the environment actually supports training. We can't afford another year of exhausted members.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I hope we can find something that isn't too hard to organize. I don't want anyone to be too stressed.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We must be precise about the costs. I'll look into the financial side to ensure we don't have any gaps.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,Forget the paperwork for a second! We need a place where people actually talk to each other and bond.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, bonding is important, but not if the budget collapses. I'll check the transport receipts and the whole-building let terms.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,I'll take the inland club accounts and the public bed rate sheet to see what the actual conditions are.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,I'll look at the public booking lottery and the canteen closure details. That should tell us about the workload.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I will check the attendance sheets for away camps and the membership list against train times.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm checking what the seniors say about mixing and the vacation timetable for our own hall.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
