30,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Transport is a huge cost variable. Also, whole-building lets are risky because we pay for drop-outs.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Shion,,"Public beds are cheap, but inland accounts show eight people per room and strict curfews. That's terrible for sleep.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Minato,,"Public bookings are a nightmare; a nine-page application and a lottery. Plus, our own canteen closes during vacation.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"A fifth of members skip away camps, and many leave the club after. Also, many can't reach campus by nine.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Takumi,,Seniors say mixing only happens when we all sleep in the same place. But our own hall is already crowded.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Misaki, if people aren't attending away camps, maybe staying local is safer? But the transport costs for local trips are lower.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, if the hall is crowded and inland dorms are cramped, we need a place with actual space to recover.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Asuka, if we stay local, we still have the cooking problem. Cooking for everyone takes hours of work.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, that's true. But if we go far, the transport costs spike and we risk more people skipping.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shion, we can't just stay on campus if the hall is full. We need a dedicated space to actually bond.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"The financial risk of a non-refundable deposit at a lodge is high, but it solves the cooking and transport issues.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Shion,,I'm against the inland center. Eight to a room is a recipe for poor performance on the final day.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Minato,,I really don't want to deal with a nine-page lottery application. It sounds like a lot of wasted effort.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"We need to be careful. If we choose a lodge and people drop out, the remaining members pay more.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"If we want the year-groups to mix, we have to get them away from their usual routines and into one building.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
