55,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A is cheap but administratively heavy. Option B is convenient but lacks cohesion. Option C is expensive and risky.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option A's sleeping conditions are unacceptable. Option B's schedule is fragmented. Option C is the only one allowing proper rest.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Minato,,"Option A is too much work. Option B is easy, but the canteen closure is a problem. Option C is the simplest to manage.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Option B is the safest for the budget, but the train times make it difficult for a third of the members.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Takumi,,Option B is a failure for bonding. Option A is too restrictive. Option C is the best for the club's spirit.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Misaki, if we go with B, we have to pay for beds for those who can't commute. That adds hidden costs.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, Option C's fixed headcount is a risk, but the training quality will be significantly higher.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Minato,,I agree with Shion. I'd rather we pay a bit more than spend my whole month on paperwork and cooking.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"I'm still worried about the budget gap. However, Option B's fragmented schedule might make the camp pointless.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Takumi,,Exactly! We need to be together. Option C gives us our own building. That's where the magic happens.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"Logically, if we want to avoid the lottery and the cooking duty, Option C is the most efficient, despite the deposit risk.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Shion,,I'm voting for C. Sleep and space are non-negotiable for a training camp.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Minato,,I'm voting for C too. It's the most peaceful option for the organizers.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"If everyone else agrees, I'll support C, provided we are very strict about the final headcount.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Takumi,,C is the only way to fix the divide between the year-groups. I'm all in.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I will also vote for C. It's the most comprehensive solution to the logistics and social issues.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
